ion":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\nThe bug starts appearing as of version 4.5.2, still reproducible in 4.7dev3\nive tracked down the bug being caused by https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/114827\n\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.5.2.stable.mono - CachyOS Linux #1 SMP PREEMPT_DYNAMIC Wed, 25 Mar 2026 16:49:22 +0000 on Wayland - X11 display driver, Multi-window, 2 monitors - OpenGL 3 (Compatibility) - AMD Radeon RX 9070 (radeonsi, gfx1201, ACO, DRM 3.64, 6.19.10-1-cachyos) - AMD Ryzen 7 7800X3D 8-Core Processor (16 threads) - 30.44 GiB memory\n\n### Issue description\n\nThe issue happens with shortened IPv6 addresses.\nWhen decoding shortened IPv6 addresses, bytes are copied over to the right like this:\n``[14882, 4660, 26505, 4626, 12850, 0, 0, 0] -> [14882, 4660, 26505, 4626, **12850**, 0, 0, **12850**]``\nhowever, the function does not set the index where it copied from to 0, this results in a wrong address. as a result the client is unable to connect to the host.\na correct function should work like this:\n``[14882, 4660, 26505, 4626, 12850, 0, 0, 0] -> [14882, 4660, 26505, 4626, **0**, 0, 0, **12850**]``\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nThis only shows the result of the issue, not the issue itself as i didnt find a function in gdscript to decode ipv6 addresses.\n\nThis requires the host to have a shortened IPv6 address.\n\n1. launch MRP on a godot build without the PR(4.5.1 for example)\n2. one player hosts, the other joins\n3. repeat with a godot build that has the PR(4.5.2 for example)\n\nwhen attempting to join on godot 4.5.1 the client can connect, on 4.5.2 the client cannot.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[multiplayer-bug-mrp.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/26390555/multiplayer-bug-mrp.zip)","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118050/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":1},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118050/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}